DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
45009::$$$message_0401_0000_0000$$$::"Urgh..."::
45010::$$$message_0401_0000_0001$$$::"What is it, boy?"::
45011::$$$message_0401_0000_0002$$$::"I'm getting an intensely bad feeling about this..."::
45012::$$$message_0401_0000_0003$$$::"Ha ha ha. I bet you are, Waver Velvet."::
45013::$$$message_0401_0000_0004$$$::"Eep..."::
45014::$$$message_0401_0000_0005$$$::"Meeting me, Kayneth El-Melloi Archibald, must be the worst encounter you could have imagined."::
45015::$$$message_0401_0000_0006$$$::"Urgh, ahh..."::
45016::$$$message_0401_0000_0007$$$::"Well, if it isn't Lancer's Master. Still acting as self-important as ever."::
45017::$$$message_0401_0000_0008$$$::"Hmph! ...Lancer."::
45018::$$$message_0401_0000_0009$$$::"Here, my lord."::
45019::$$$message_0401_0000_0010$$$::"It's Lancer!"::
45020::$$$message_0401_0000_0011$$$::"I believe this will be our first duel, Rider. My spears have yet to taste blood tonight... They thirst for yours."::
45021::$$$message_0401_0000_0012$$$::(Ohmygosh. Lancer, you're so cool!)::
45023::$$$message_0401_0000_0014$$$::"While Lancer and Rider fight, why don't you and I have a friendly conversation, between teacher and pupil?"::
45024::$$$message_0401_0000_0015$$$::"Aaaah...eeek..."::
45025::$$$message_0401_0000_0016$$$::(And Kayneth...bullying is such a bad look.)::
45026::$$$message_0401_0000_0017$$$::"Feel free to turn and run, leaving everything unfinished as lowborn bloodlines are wont to do."::
45027::$$$message_0401_0000_0018$$$::"..."::
45028::$$$message_0401_0000_0019$$$::"Or would you like to get on your knees and beg for mercy?[wvl canskip=false time=200][hffgchg2 chara=ケイネス face=怒2 pos=right time=400 twno=1][hfangry layer=1] In either case, your fate is sealed. Regret your life as you die!"::
45029::$$$message_0401_0000_0020$$$::"Kh...grr...."::
45030::$$$message_0401_0000_0021$$$::"Grr...gah...rrrgh..."::
45031::$$$message_0401_0000_0022$$$::"...Waver Velvet?"::
45032::$$$message_0401_0000_0023$$$::"C...C...CAN IT, YOU TOSSER![wvl][hfwww layer=0] You're nothing compared to a Servant!"::
45033::$$$message_0401_0000_0024$$$::"What!?"::
45034::$$$message_0401_0000_0025$$$::"That's right! I've fought a Berserker on a fighter jet and a giant sea monster!"::
45035::$$$message_0401_0000_0026$$$::"Why would I be scared of you, you big jerk!"::
45036::$$$message_0401_0000_0027$$$::"Hahahahaha! That's right, my Master has braved many battlefields at my side!"::
45037::$$$message_0401_0000_0028$$$::"He's proven his wisdom, skill, and valor, unlike a Master who lurks in the shadows!"::
45038::$$$message_0401_0000_0029$$$::"How dare you speak to me that way!"::
45039::$$$message_0401_0000_0030$$$::"Prof[line len=2]No,[wvl][hfangry layer=0] Kayneth El-Melloi Archibald! I challenge you to a duel!"::
45040::$$$message_0401_0000_0031$$$::"How DARE you! You utter scum! You are beneath even a third-rate mage!"::
45041::$$$message_0401_0000_0032$$$::"Hmph. Sorry, Master of Lancer. Looks like you'll have to give up on curing that receding hairline."::
45042::$$$message_0401_0000_0033$$$::"W-w-we're not talking about that right now!!!"::
45043::$$$message_0401_0000_0034$$$::"It bothers him, huh..."::
45044::$$$message_0401_0000_0035$$$::"It bothers him..."::
45045::$$$message_0401_0000_0036$$$::"Worry not, my lord! Your hairline is still intact! There is still plenty of hair to lose!"::
45046::$$$message_0401_0000_0037$$$::"NOBODY ASKED YOU! Dammit, I know what I'm wishing for now! I'll kill everyone who's better looking than meeee!"::
45047::$$$message_0401_0000_0038$$$::"My, Kayneth. Did I just hear you say something silly? Take that back or I'll murder you."::
45048::$$$message_0401_0000_0039$$$::"...Hey, are we having a duel or what?"::
�